<title>UK: UK's DTI clears Stakis' Metropole merger.</title>
<headline>UK's DTI clears Stakis' Metropole merger.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Britain's Department of Trade and Industry said on Wednesday it had decided not to refer Stakis Plc's acquisition of Metropole Hotels to the Monopolies and Mergers Commission.</p>
<p>Stakis, a hotel and casino group, bought Metropole for 327 million pounds from Lonrho Plc in October last year. --London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
